// CYBERMEDIC MDE ADVANCED HUNTING
// Query name: CYBERMEDIC Daily IOC Hunt
// Description: Exact IOC matches with CTI provenance and telemetry source.
// Author: CYBERMEDIC
// Business date: 2026-09-24
// Lookback: 30 days
// Schema reference: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/defender-xdr/advanced-hunting-schema-tables
